{"articleNo":"151755","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=151755&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2016학년도 하계 필리핀 단기연수 면접일시 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.05.27","hit":"2665","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2016학년도 하계 필리핀 단기연수 지원자의 면접을 아래와 같이 실시합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></font></span><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">면접시간은 면접 상황에따라 약간의 변동 가능성이 있으므로</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">본인의 면접시간 <u><font color=\"#000000\">5~10분전에 대기</font></u>하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p></span><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">면접 지각 혹은 불참 시 자동으로 </span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\" color=\"#000000\"><u>불합격</u></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 처리되며,</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">공고된 면접시간은 변경이 <u><font color=\"#000000\">불가</font></u> 합니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span>&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">면접일시 : 2016년 5월 30일 월요일 2pm ~</font></strong></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">면접대기 : 테크노관 465호 멀티미디어실</font></strong></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">면접장소 : 테크노관 458호 국제교류교육원</font></strong></span></span></font></p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 수업시간과 면접시간이 중복되는&nbsp;학생에 한하여 면접 참가 확인서(공결증빙서류)가 주어집니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">문의 : 국제교류교육원 신지민 ☎ 478-7215</span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></p><table style=\"WIDTH: 207pt; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"276\" border=\"0\"><colgroup><col style=\"WIDTH: 20pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 864\" width=\"27\"><col style=\"WIDTH: 30pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 1280\" width=\"40\"><col style=\"WIDTH: 44pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 1888\" width=\"59\"><col style=\"WIDTH: 113pt; mso-width-source: userset; mso-width-alt: 4800\" width=\"150\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"HEIGHT: 15p